schway-screen 1
screen approval-command
title Approve a command
description A mutating command waits for an interactive approval choice.
variant light-50x8
size 50x8
cursor 1 1 hidden
== text
  Allow bash? · ask mode

  bun test --filter clamp

  › Allow once
    Allow bash for this session
    Deny with reason…
 Ask · Enter allow once · Esc deny
